WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Bizzy worked together with AI artist Nimi.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.360
I'm a big fan.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.480
In recent months you saw Nimi in the car, at home, behind the piano.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.920
In radio studios and at festivals.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.880
All made with AI.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.960
When I found out that Nimi was an AI artist, I didn't know that at first.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.480
Then I thought, no, this is the enemy.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.640
I can't like this.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:29.000
But why did you think, I send my message, do you want to work together?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.240
I'm a curious guy.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.080
He called the people behind the account.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.040
Then I found out that there was a musical story behind it.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:42.800
It's not as siloed as it seems when you listen to AI-generated music.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:43.960
It's a group.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:49.960
They're also boys with African descent, so it's not digital blackface or anything.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.960
I've heard a lot of AI music, but you always hear that it's super plastic.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:58.360
And this didn't feel like that to me.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Thank you, thank you, thank you

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
So this song with Nimi will be released on October 30th

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
People who are listening now will think I'm 18 and I'm a talented upcoming artist

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Why don't you ask me?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
I probably didn't have your demo or it wasn't good enough

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.000
But you can just send me your demos

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
If you just like it, you will be very good at it

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
And you just have to believe in yourself and not in technology

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Because we are not dependent on that when it comes to music
